        <reference value="Patient/PatientExampleRural"/>
      </reference>
      <name value="Example: Rural HF Patient (high-distance, limited support)"/>
      <description value="A 78-year-old patient living alone in a rural county without a local cardiologist (87 miles to nearest cardiology care). Demonstrates use of HeartlandDistanceToCardiology and HeartlandSocialSupportScore extensions. Modeled on the cohort described in HEARTLAND Protocol v3.2 background data."/>
