      </reference>
      <name value="HEARTLAND Distance to Cardiology"/>
      <description value="Driving distance in miles from the patient's residence to the nearest cardiologist. Used by the HEARTLAND risk score: distance &gt;50 miles contributes 1 point. Rural counties without a cardiologist average 87 miles to nearest cardiology care vs 16 miles in counties with one (HEARTLAND Protocol v3.2, Module 2)."/>
      <exampleBoolean value="false"/>
    </resource>
