      <name value="HEARTLAND Monitoring Track Assignment"/>
      <description value="Records a documented CarePlan monitoring route: Track A (digital) or Track B (analog, telephone/paper). Access, patient preference and the supported local plan inform the choice; facility tier alone does not select a route. The code does not prove contact, completed monitoring or equivalent outcomes, and does not change clinical requirements. No third hybrid code is defined."/>
      <exampleBoolean value="false"/>
    </resource>
